<title>USA: Smith Barney downgrades News to neutral.</title>
<headline>Smith Barney downgrades News to neutral.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney analyst John Reidy said he downgraded News Corp Ltd to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>Reidy cited the likelihood that the company's entrance in domestic satellite TV business &quot;is going to drag on&quot;.</p>
<p>He also said he saw &quot;tough comparisons in its television and cable business,&quot; due in part to start-up costs of Fox News.</p>
<p>He also said it would be tough to follow box office performances of &quot;Independence Day&quot; and &quot;Star Wars&quot; movies.</p>
<p>The company's ADRs fell 1/8 to 18-1/2.</p>
